<title>USA: Xpedite mulls $22.50/shr takeover bid.</title>
<headline>Xpedite mulls $22.50/shr takeover bid.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xpedite Systems Inc said Monday it had received an indication of interest from an investor group about acquiring the company for $22.50 cash per share.</p>
<p>The investor group includes members of the company's senior management, Xpedite said.</p>
<p>The Xpedite board has formed a committee to evaluate the offer, the company said.</p>
<p>It also said its board would evaluate strategic alternatives, including possible business combinations, leveraged recapitalization transactions, &quot;or other methods for enhancing stockholder value.&quot;</p>
<p>Xpedite said it had retained Merrill Lynch &amp; Co to assist it in the evaluation.</p>
